<h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;">Inquiry confirmed 🎉</h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
  Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Great news — your inquiry has been <strong>confirmed</strong> for:
  <strong>{{tourName}}</strong>.
</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%; background:#f0fdf4; border:1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius:10px; padding:14px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;"><strong>Participants:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;">{{participants}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;"><strong>Dates:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;">{{startDate}} → {{endDate}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;"><strong>Total amount:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;">{{currency}} {{totalPrice}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;"><strong>Status:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;">CONFIRMED</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0;">
  If you need any adjustments, reply to this email and our team will help.
</p>

<p style="margin:14px 0 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:13px;">
  Inquiry ID: <code>{{inquiryId}}</code>
</p>
